MIXING SOP AR/FR

STEP 1: OIL BLEND
Measure oils with syringe. Pour into bottle.

STEP 2: ADD DPG
99dh: 6ml | 129dh: 7.5ml. Swirl 30s

STEP 3: ADD ALCOHOL 96%
99dh: 26.5ml | 129dh: 22.5ml. Fill to 50ml

STEP 4: MACERATION
99dh: 14 Days | 129dh: 21 Days. Dark cool place. Shake every 3 days

STEP 5: FILTER + LABEL
After maceration, filter once. Add sprayer + label

